WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
CHOWK simulates mixed traffic along a five-junction Indian arterial.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Drag the divider to compare two controllers on identical demand.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Two-wheelers filter through gaps beside stopped traffic.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:43.000
The pressure overlay shows how much of each approach is occupied.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Both simulations receive an ambulance at the same tick.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
A demand surge tests how the controllers respond to a busier approach.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Results reports the held-out benchmark. The browser rerun is edited for time.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Each rerun checks the state hash and metrics against the published result.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Method explains the simulator, training and validation. All results are simulated.
